1
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,400
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:27,800
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,360 --> 00:00:30,680
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,400
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,080
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:42,760
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:48,440
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,760
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:58,600
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,600 --> 00:00:59,520
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:04,160
=Episode 18=

12
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:05,359
Ye!

13
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:06,719
Is that any way to treat me?

14
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:09,480
You vanished on my wedding day

15
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,840
without a word,

16
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:12,319
and I searched everywhere for you.

17
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,640
Boss,

18
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,840
I had no choice, I swear.

19
00:01:16,400 --> 00:01:19,359
You have no idea what it was like.

20
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:25,040
(The wedding day)

21
00:01:25,040 --> 00:01:26,599
Miss Feng Weiyue,

22
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,200
do you take Prince of Rong
as your husband,

23
00:01:30,200 --> 00:01:32,200
in poverty and in wealth?

24
00:01:35,599 --> 00:01:36,480
I do.

25
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,519
Prince of Rong...

26
00:01:52,359 --> 00:01:55,599
Bold brat, raiding Prince Rong's Mansion
on the wedding day?

27
00:01:56,079 --> 00:01:57,959
What do you think this is,
a palace drama?

28
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:00,439
Sect Master Ye, the sect's infighting
has been put down.

29
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:03,159
Your daughter, Miss Lu Ningyan,
has woken.

30
00:02:03,719 --> 00:02:06,519
Please return to the sect at once
and take charge.

31
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,879
The sect?

32
00:02:07,879 --> 00:02:08,520
My daughter?

33
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,840
Hey, what are you talking about?

34
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,759
Huh? You...

35
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:33,560
Right.

36
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:37,719
I am Ye Yuntian,
Sect Master of Xingyun Sect.

37
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:39,840
Three years ago,

38
00:02:40,439 --> 00:02:41,439
I had finally found

39
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:42,800
the daughter I lost so many years ago.

40
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:44,039
Then the sect rebelled.

41
00:02:44,719 --> 00:02:45,879
I fought back with all my strength,

42
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:47,319
and it threw my inner power into chaos.

43
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:49,560
So I drifted from place to place
until I reached the Imperial City

44
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:51,120
and became a beggar.

45
00:02:52,439 --> 00:02:54,199
Oh, I'm sorry, boss.

46
00:02:54,479 --> 00:02:57,039
At that moment, the original Ye's
memories crashed into my head

47
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:58,520
like a river bursting its banks.

48
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,840
It shook me to the core.

49
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,840
I was completely rattled,

50
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:03,400
so I couldn't think about anything else.

51
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,960
That's why
I couldn't make it to your wedding.

52
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,199
So...

53
00:03:06,319 --> 00:03:07,560
You're saying

54
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:11,599
all the memories of this body
have come back?

55
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,560
Yeah, every memory.

56
00:03:12,719 --> 00:03:13,120
Guess what?

57
00:03:13,919 --> 00:03:15,680
It's a strange feeling.

58
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:16,759
I'm still me,

59
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:19,599
but at times I'm not the same man I was.

60
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,360
Of course you're not the same.

61
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:24,080
You're the Sect Master
of Xingyun Sect now.

62
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,879
Before, you were all alone.

63
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,080
Now it's different.

64
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:29,199
You've got an heir!

65
00:03:29,199 --> 00:03:31,039
Haha.

66
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:40,080
When will the original memories
of this body of mine

67
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,759
come back?

68
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:46,800
Ye,

69
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,840
even if something urgent came up,

70
00:03:48,879 --> 00:03:49,960
you still can't just leave
without a word.

71
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,080
When I saw that pool of blood,

72
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,159
I was scared out of my wits!

73
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:53,800
I thought...

74
00:03:53,919 --> 00:03:55,719
I thought you'd croaked
in this ancient world.

75
00:03:56,439 --> 00:03:57,560
I'm truly sorry, boss.

76
00:03:57,759 --> 00:03:59,479
I just wanted to see my daughter once

77
00:03:59,479 --> 00:04:00,599
and then come find you.

78
00:04:00,759 --> 00:04:03,560
But they insisted I preside over
the Xingyun Sect contest.

79
00:04:03,919 --> 00:04:05,639
- So...
- Oh right, the succession contest.

80
00:04:05,759 --> 00:04:07,520
That's why Mo Yuya and I came.

81
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:09,879
What's going on?

82
00:04:15,879 --> 00:04:18,360
Foreign forces have infiltrated
Xingyun Sect?

83
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,319
Mo Yuya said

84
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:23,319
the Sect Master seat in this contest
is crucial.

85
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,199
It must not fall into foreign hands.

86
00:04:26,319 --> 00:04:28,680
Boss, what do you need me to do?

87
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:33,160
Do you have anyone you trust completely
right now?

88
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,000
Someone I trust...

89
00:04:41,200 --> 00:04:43,519
Me? Am I your disciple?

90
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,240
At least you learned a few moves
from me.

91
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:48,319
I only learned a few moves.

92
00:04:49,519 --> 00:04:50,000
Then...

93
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:51,600
Ningyan is the only one left.

94
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:52,639
Then bring her in.

95
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:56,199
Since she was Mo Yuya's shadow guard,

96
00:04:57,079 --> 00:04:58,160
her skills should be decent.

97
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:01,160
Oh, boss,

98
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,040
here's something you don't know.

99
00:05:03,279 --> 00:05:04,560
Before she was taken back to the sect

100
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:05,720
and reunited with me,

101
00:05:05,839 --> 00:05:07,199
she was already badly wounded.

102
00:05:07,360 --> 00:05:09,079
She's recovering now,

103
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:11,040
so she can't use her inner power.

104
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:12,879
Then what do we do?

105
00:05:13,959 --> 00:05:15,959
If you want to take
the Sect Master seat,

106
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,759
you'll have to rely on yourself.

107
00:05:20,360 --> 00:05:21,519
I can't do it.

108
00:05:21,839 --> 00:05:22,319
What can I do?

109
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,560
Am I supposed to become
a peerless expert in a month?

110
00:05:25,680 --> 00:05:27,800
You have far more potential
than they do.

111
00:05:28,079 --> 00:05:29,839
Remember what I once told you?

112
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:32,199
Your inner-power foundation
is better than theirs.

113
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,959
I just don't know why

114
00:05:34,079 --> 00:05:36,000
all the meridians in your body
are sealed.

115
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,879
With a little guidance,

116
00:05:37,959 --> 00:05:39,480
you'd leave them all in the dust.

117
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,399
Thanks for the vote of confidence,

118
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:44,199
but I really can't.

119
00:05:44,319 --> 00:05:44,879
Hey,

120
00:05:45,319 --> 00:05:47,759
what if I find you a master
to spar with?

121
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:50,439
If you have a master,
just order them to fight.

122
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:51,480
All that nonsense was meaningless.

123
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,800
I can't.

124
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:54,800
The person I have in mind...

125
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:57,199
I don't dare give orders to.

126
00:05:58,199 --> 00:05:58,879
Who is it?

127
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,279
I'll call him now.

128
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,240
Wait a moment.

129
00:06:21,519 --> 00:06:22,319
Where's Ye?

130
00:06:25,160 --> 00:06:27,680
Your Highness, you really are magnetic,

131
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,000
leaving a trail of broken hearts
wherever you go.

132
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:33,079
What nonsense are you talking about?

133
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:35,120
She was my former shadow guard.

134
00:06:37,480 --> 00:06:42,199
A mere shadow guard? Or the kind
who gazes at you doe-eyed with a story?

135
00:06:43,439 --> 00:06:44,800
What do you mean, a story?

136
00:06:45,439 --> 00:06:46,319
You're getting more ridiculous.

137
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,800
So you're saying I'm making a fuss
over nothing?

138
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:51,639
What kind of shadow guard
throws herself into her master's arms

139
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,040
the moment she sees him,

140
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:54,000
holds his hand, and whispers?

141
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:57,120
What can't be said out loud?

142
00:06:58,839 --> 00:07:00,199
You jerk. Don't talk to me.

143
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:11,160
Suppose Lu Ningyan's feelings for me
were one-sided.

144
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:14,040
But I never showed her any favor.

145
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,439
If that counts as
leaving a trail of broken hearts,

146
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:17,480
then...

147
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:21,759
Who didn't break a few hearts
in their youth?

148
00:07:24,199 --> 00:07:25,120
I didn't.

149
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:27,920
Boss, he's here.

150
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,800
Check out the sparring partner
I found you.

151
00:07:34,519 --> 00:07:35,519
Mr. Jun?

152
00:07:52,079 --> 00:07:54,240
Weiyue, you dropped your bracelet.

153
00:07:54,439 --> 00:07:55,480
(No way.)

154
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,639
(Could my destined lover)

155
00:07:57,959 --> 00:08:00,639
(be Mr. Jun, the man I've secretly
crushed on for years?)

156
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,920
Oh, thank you, Mr. Jun.

157
00:08:05,199 --> 00:08:09,399
I hear your Tech Space prototype
is about to be tested.

158
00:08:11,439 --> 00:08:13,879
I'd love to come see it then.

159
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:15,120
Sure.

160
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,039
Mr. Jun?

161
00:08:18,479 --> 00:08:18,960
Weiyue,

162
00:08:19,400 --> 00:08:20,440
I finally found you.

163
00:08:25,440 --> 00:08:27,440
So much for saying
you don't break hearts.

164
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,439
It's a misunderstanding.

165
00:08:35,959 --> 00:08:37,679
A misunderstanding, haha.

166
00:08:38,079 --> 00:08:40,480
You and Ye are two of my
most valuable employees.

167
00:08:40,919 --> 00:08:41,919
If an experiment

168
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,319
left you in another world,

169
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:44,319
how could I ever answer for it?

170
00:08:45,079 --> 00:08:47,039
Thank goodness I've found you both.

171
00:08:55,679 --> 00:08:56,480
Hello.

172
00:09:11,439 --> 00:09:12,400
I'm Mo Yuya,

173
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,240
Feng Weiyue's husband.

174
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,600
I'm Yuan Qing.
In the 21st century, my surname is Jun.

175
00:09:19,159 --> 00:09:20,760
I was her boss.

176
00:09:21,640 --> 00:09:22,559
In Yinbei,

177
00:09:23,520 --> 00:09:26,439
men and women keep their distance.
Just so you know.

178
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,880
Hey, Mr. Jun,

179
00:09:37,319 --> 00:09:42,000
how did you end up
a disciple of Xingyun Sect?

180
00:09:42,559 --> 00:09:45,000
So will you be teaching me martial arts

181
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,319
from now on?

182
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:49,640
You used to treat me with such respect.

183
00:09:50,079 --> 00:09:52,760
It's nice to be on a different footing
for a change.

184
00:09:59,079 --> 00:10:00,520
No need to trouble you, Yuan Qing.

185
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:02,400
From now on,

186
00:10:03,039 --> 00:10:04,319
I'll be the one teaching Weiyue.

187
00:10:04,559 --> 00:10:05,919
The Sect Master contest is at hand,

188
00:10:06,600 --> 00:10:08,240
and outside techniques don't count.

189
00:10:09,159 --> 00:10:11,959
I wonder when you learned
our Xingyun Sect's martial arts.

190
00:10:12,959 --> 00:10:14,959
(My first crush and my true love)

191
00:10:15,520 --> 00:10:17,079
(are at each other's throats over me.)

192
00:10:18,880 --> 00:10:20,679
(Oh, this deadly charm of mine.)

193
00:10:24,799 --> 00:10:25,360
Hey,

194
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,000
um...

195
00:10:28,280 --> 00:10:29,679
Gentlemen,

196
00:10:30,039 --> 00:10:31,959
Weiyue just arrived,
worn out from the journey.

197
00:10:32,280 --> 00:10:35,240
Whatever it is,
let's talk about it later.

198
00:10:39,640 --> 00:10:41,640
Hey, boss,

199
00:10:41,919 --> 00:10:43,079
let's talk another day.

200
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:45,959
Mo Yuya!

201
00:10:46,439 --> 00:10:46,760
Oh,

202
00:10:47,159 --> 00:10:48,199
don't be angry.

203
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:49,400
He's just my boss.

204
00:10:49,520 --> 00:10:51,319
He just got excited
seeing someone he knows.

205
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,079
There's really nothing between us.

206
00:10:55,600 --> 00:10:56,640
Then why does he keep hugging you?

207
00:10:56,720 --> 00:10:58,640
I pushed him away, didn't I?

208
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,039
That's basic manners where we come from.

209
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:02,640
You wouldn't understand.

210
00:11:02,720 --> 00:11:04,159
Fine. I don't understand.

211
00:11:05,319 --> 00:11:06,480
You two are the same kind.

212
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:09,199
I'm just a passerby in your life.

213
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:10,640
An outsider.

214
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:14,520
Oh, please. Now you're sulking?

215
00:11:14,959 --> 00:11:17,559
Heh. I haven't even brought up
you and Lu Ningyan.

216
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:33,240
Ugh.

217
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:39,600
There's really nothing

218
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:41,240
between me and Lu Ningyan.

219
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:42,959
Even if there were,

220
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,760
it was one-sided on her part.

221
00:11:46,120 --> 00:11:47,280
That I can promise.

222
00:11:48,079 --> 00:11:48,919
But can you

223
00:11:49,240 --> 00:11:52,760
promise your feelings
for Mr. Jun are innocent?

224
00:11:55,039 --> 00:11:57,959
I... Even if before, with him...

225
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:00,039
He and I...

226
00:12:00,839 --> 00:12:02,480
I have you now, don't I?

227
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:07,400
From now on, there can only be me
in your heart.

228
00:12:09,799 --> 00:12:10,919
So domineering.

229
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:13,560
Weiyue,

230
00:12:15,120 --> 00:12:18,600
don't you still owe me a wedding night?

231
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:25,240
I'll give it to you.

232
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:27,959
But not now.

233
00:12:29,360 --> 00:12:31,199
I've got a new gadget.

234
00:12:39,919 --> 00:12:40,679
What is this?

235
00:12:44,079 --> 00:12:45,640
Lie down over there.

236
00:12:56,679 --> 00:13:00,000
My dear, so tonight you'll be on top?

237
00:13:12,360 --> 00:13:13,520
Oh my.

238
00:13:17,640 --> 00:13:19,640
This could pass for an idol photocard.

239
00:13:20,199 --> 00:13:22,760
If I made these into a photo book
and sold it,

240
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:25,280
I'd make a killing.

241
00:13:27,600 --> 00:13:28,679
What is this?

242
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,799
How can a portrait be made this fast?

243
00:13:31,039 --> 00:13:31,480
Oh,

244
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:34,000
this is called a Polaroid.

245
00:13:34,280 --> 00:13:36,240
And what comes out of it

246
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:38,240
is called a photograph.

247
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:39,199
Yeah.

248
00:13:39,559 --> 00:13:41,079
Don't blink now.

249
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,880
My dear, you always have
some new gadget.

250
00:13:55,079 --> 00:13:57,199
Tell me,

251
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,319
do you think there will come a day

252
00:13:59,959 --> 00:14:02,839
when you find something
even more wondrous

253
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,159
or

254
00:14:06,079 --> 00:14:06,880
someone new?

255
00:14:08,839 --> 00:14:10,439
And then choose to

256
00:14:11,799 --> 00:14:15,159
leave me and never be with me again?

257
00:14:15,760 --> 00:14:17,559
Mo Yuya, what nonsense
are you talking about?

258
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,880
We're newlyweds.

259
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:23,240
Even if we never finished the ceremony,

260
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:25,880
I'm not letting you go.

261
00:14:26,959 --> 00:14:27,919
As for you,

262
00:14:28,520 --> 00:14:31,640
I won't allow you to be alone
with Lu Ningyan again.

263
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:33,880
Your call.

264
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,480
Tell you what.

265
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:39,799
It's a long night.

266
00:14:40,199 --> 00:14:41,760
Let's get down to proper business first.

267
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:17,880
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

268
00:15:18,080 --> 00:15:20,400
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

269
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:24,440
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

270
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:27,240
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

271
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:31,240
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

272
00:15:31,800 --> 00:15:34,040
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

273
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:39,640
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

274
00:15:42,520 --> 00:15:44,920
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

275
00:15:45,560 --> 00:15:48,240
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

276
00:15:49,400 --> 00:15:52,040
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

277
00:15:52,400 --> 00:15:54,600
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

278
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:58,760
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

279
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:01,480
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

280
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,400
♪This love remains unchanged♪

281
00:16:03,400 --> 00:16:06,920
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

282
00:16:08,640 --> 00:16:11,080
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

283
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:15,200
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

284
00:16:15,560 --> 00:16:17,960
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

285
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:19,840
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

286
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,600
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

287
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,960
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

288
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:29,280
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

289
00:16:29,760 --> 00:16:31,640
♪I don't regret that vow♪

290
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:35,120
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
